#. module: l10n_cssk_income_tax_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_income_tax_base.field_cssk_income_tax_version__rate_bands
msgid ""
"Statutory income-tax rate schedule keyed on the revenue line (SK: § 15 by "
"r560): ordered [upper_bound, rate_percent] pairs, upper_bound inclusive, "
"null = top band (must be last). Example (SK 2025): [[100000.0, 10.0], "
"[5000000.0, 21.0], [null, 24.0]]."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_cssk_income_tax_base
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_income_tax_base.field_cssk_income_tax_version__min_tax_bands
msgid ""
"Statutory minimum tax (SK: § 46b minimálna daň / daňová licencia) keyed on the same revenue line: ordered [upper_bound, amount] pairs, upper_bound inclusive, null = top band (must be last).\n"
"\n"
"A band may carry a third element naming a condition that turnover cannot express — the SK daňová licencia puts 480 € and 960 € at the SAME bound and tells them apart by whether the taxpayer was a platiteľ DPH on the last day of the period: [[500000.0, 480.0, 'not_vat_payer'], [500000.0, 960.0, 'vat_payer'], [null, 2880.0]]. Bands are tried in order and one whose condition does not hold is skipped.\n"
"\n"
"Leave empty for forms without a minimum tax."
msgstr ""

